  flagsOnComplete: []
  stepText:
  - Take the lane to Nacre
  - Find the hauler on line nine hundred and four
  - Find the tug Welcome Back
  - Bring in the navigators' pod
  - Go back to Many Hands, and find somebody who has moved a town
  - Catch up with the Meridian Crawl on Duskline
  - Re-mate three couplings and bring the tread-hall in ahead of the dawn
  - Go home
  - Attend the town meeting
  - Reopen the separation joints under the promenade
  - Release the Foundry Saint's arms, and take the override off its back
  - Hold the lamp for Hal
  - Walk the town. There is no hurry.
  - Keep the Debris Cutter off the districts as they lift
  - See where every road out now runs
  rewardsRolled: 1
